# npm scratch. `npx wrangler` writes these when it resolves a package, so every ship recreated
# them and the NEXT ship refused to deploy with "uncommitted runtime changes" — a loop where each
# deploy blocked the following one. Neither file has ever been tracked; this repo has no npm
# manifest of its own.
